OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOrganised showers, heavy at
OL,6,Ftimes, generally break up and ease
OL,7,Fthrough the day, with winds becoming
OL,8,Flight after a breezy start.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average for late
OL,10,FOctober.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry, clear and mild night
OL,13,Ffor most, with the odd mist and fog
OL,14,Fpatch forming in rural areas. Light
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FMany areas dry with long
OL,18,Fsunny spells, with the odd shower
OL,19,Fpossible in Cumbria in the morning.
OL,20,FLight winds and temperatures near
OL,21,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
