OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled to end the week, with sunny
OL,7,Fspells through Saturday. Cloudier with
OL,8,Frain possible on Sunday. Overnight,
OL,9,Ffog and mist forming, this perhaps
OL,10,Flingering through the mornings.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
